<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera estimate raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Scott Randall raised his earnings estimates on Altera Corp for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $1.61 per share from $1.59.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $2.02 per share from $1.95.</p>
<p>-- Kept short- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
</text>
